flowchart TB
  subgraph runtime_recovery[Hook runtime recovery]
    direction LR
    V[Codex hook command] --> W[Pinned bootstrap]
    W --> X{Session ID and lexical PLUGIN_ROOT}
    X -->|first use| Y[Immutable runtime snapshot in PLUGIN_DATA]
    X -->|cache pruned| Y
    Y --> Z[Bound hook runtime]
    X -->|new root after refresh| AA[Snapshot new runtime]
    AA --> Z
  end

  subgraph runtime[Runtime data flow]
    direction LR
    A[Codex tool result] --> B[PostToolUse]
    B --> C{Active model}
    C -->|gpt-6-astra| D[4 KiB Astra]
    C -->|all others| E[6 KiB default]
    D --> F{Packable result and net savings?}
    E --> F
    F -->|yes| G[exact local artifact]
    G --> H[sanitized bounded receipt]
    H --> I[Non-blocking PostToolUse feedback]
    I --> IA[Direct mode may retain original]
    I --> IB[Code-mode script may retain original]
    G --> J[per-model report]
    F -->|no| K[Original result unchanged]
  end

  subgraph verification_debt[Verification debt and compaction lifecycle]
    direction LR
    L[Successful apply_patch] --> M[Pending verification debt]
    M --> N{Verifier with trusted status}
    N -->|exit 0| O[Debt cleared]
    N -->|nonzero or absent| P[Debt remains]
    P --> Q[Stop warns; answer continues]
    M --> R[PreCompact reads durable state]
    R --> S[Codex compacts]
    S --> T[PostCompact records lifecycle]
    T --> U[Compact SessionStart restores debt reminder]
    U --> N
  end
